ę Detektywów o pomoc. Czy dzięki współpracy rozwikłają zagadkę i udaremnią plany najbardziej nikczemnych czarnych charakterków, jakich widział świat?","popularity":2.5078,"poster_path":"/zsquD434dfSo2BCU7aQkOyvBt1J.jpg","release_date":"2018-01-31","softcore":false,"video":false,"vote_average":7.2,"vote_count":267,"credit_id":"5a63a2b2c3a3687f7101346a","department":"Production","job":"Producer"},{"adult":false,"backdrop_path":null,"genre_ids":[16],"id":1138290,"title":"Meet the Flinstones","original_language":"en","original_title":"Meet the Flinstones","overview":"","popularity":0.44,"poster_path":null,"release_date":"","softcore":false,"video":false,"vote_average":0.0,"vote_count":0,"credit_id":"6483908dbf31f2505880e094","department":"Writing","job":"Screenplay"},{"adult":false,"backdrop_path":"/j5IKfaaWd15dcrewlSSA0NRZpMG.jpg","genre_ids":[28,16,12,10751,878],"id":411736,"title":"Batman: Return of the Caped Crusaders","original_language":"en","original_title":"Batman: Return of the Caped Crusaders","overview":"","popularity":3.6167,"poster_path":"/kXV5rVxxRYWHksELUi6dxzWG7Sj.jpg","release_date":"2016-10-08","softcore":false,"video":false,"vote_average":6.505,"vote_count":296,"credit_id":"5bdf372e92514137cb0283fb","department":"Production","job":"Producer"},{"adult":false,"backdrop_path":"/6FTc6G8gwawItBqGQd7sYtf6s3f.jpg","genre_ids":[16,28,35,878],"id":474395,"title":"Młodzi Tytani: Akcja! Film","original_language":"en","original_title":"Teen Titans Go! To the Movies","overview":"Młodzi Tytani też chcą mieć film o swoich przygodach, dlatego wyruszają do Tinsel Town, by do pomysłu przekonać znanego reżysera.","popularity":6.1378,"poster_path":"/8BPH7lC67sZG02JbpRnA5cFeSJn.jpg","release_date":"2018-07-27","softcore":false,"video":false,"vote_average":7.166,"vote_count":1185,"credit_id":"5c32c3a39251416e4572d403","department":"Production","job":"Producer"},{"adult":false,"backdrop_path":"/vg3TwaY1rj0ETlFCTha8tm9tJVL.jpg","genre_ids":[16,28,12,14,878],"id":640810,"titl